00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:51.959
That's just the way it works, right?

00:01:51.959 --> 00:01:52.959
It's not my opinion.

00:01:52.959 --> 00:01:53.959
That's just the way it works.

00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:55.240
